#: modernsystem/config/config.cpp:62
msgid "&Show window resize handle"
msgstr "&Wëskrzëni ùchwët zmianë miarë"

#: modernsystem/config/config.cpp:64
msgid ""
"When selected, all windows are drawn with a resize handle at the lower right "
"corner. This makes window resizing easier, especially for trackballs and "
"other mouse replacements on laptops."
msgstr ""
"Czej ta òptacëjô je zaznaczonô, wszëtczé òkna malowóné są z chwëtã zmianë "
"miarë òkna w prawim dolnym rogù. To zletcziwô zmianë miarë òkna, òsoblëwie "
"dlô trackballów ë mëszów brëkòwónëch na laptopach."

#: modernsystem/config/config.cpp:78
msgid "Here you can change the size of the resize handle."
msgstr "Tuwò mòżesz zmienic wielgòsc chwëtu zmianë miarë"

#: modernsystem/config/config.cpp:87 oxygen/oxygenconfiguration.cpp:196
msgid "Small"
msgstr "Môłi"

#: modernsystem/config/config.cpp:89
msgid "Medium"
msgstr "Strzédny"

#: modernsystem/config/config.cpp:91 oxygen/oxygenconfiguration.cpp:198
#: oxygen/oxygenconfiguration.cpp:241
msgid "Large"
msgstr "Wiôldżi"

#: modernsystem/modernsys.cpp:457
msgid "Modern System"
msgstr "Nowòczasnô systema"

#: laptop/laptopclient.cpp:372
msgid "Laptop"
msgstr "Laptop"

#: b2/config/config.cpp:61
msgid ""
"When selected, the window borders are drawn using the titlebar colors; "
"otherwise, they are drawn using normal border colors."
msgstr ""
"Jeżlë ta òptacëjô je zaznaczonô, ramë òknów bãdą céchòwóné farwamatitlowich "
"listwów. W procëmnym razu bãdą òne miałë sztandardową farwã ramë."

#: b2/config/config.cpp:67
msgid "Draw &resize handle"
msgstr "Céchùjë chwët &zmianë miarë"

#: b2/config/config.cpp:69
msgid ""
"When selected, decorations are drawn with a \"grab handle\" in the bottom "
"right corner of the windows; otherwise, no grab handle is drawn."
msgstr ""
"Czedë ta òptacëjô je zaznaczonô, òbstrojënczi céchòwóné bãdą z chwëtã zmianë "
"miarë òkna w prawim, dolnëm rogù. W procëmnym razu chwët nie mdze céchòwóny."

#: b2/config/config.cpp:75
msgid "Auto-move titlebar"
msgstr "Przeniesë aùtomatno listew titla"

#: b2/config/config.cpp:77
msgid ""
"When selected, titlebars are automatically relocated to visible positions; "
"otherwise, they are only moved manually using shift+drag."
msgstr ""
"Jeżlë wëbróné, to listwa titla je aùtomatno przeniosłô na widzawné "
"pòłożenié: w procëmnym przëtrôfkù je nót jã rãczno przeniesc brëkùjąc shift"
"+przecygnie."

#: b2/config/config.cpp:82
msgid "Actions Settings"
msgstr "Nastôwë dzejaniô"

#: b2/config/config.cpp:85
msgid "Double click on menu button:"
msgstr "Dëbeltné klëkniãcé na knąpie menu:"

#: b2/config/config.cpp:87
msgid "Do Nothing"
msgstr "Nie robi nick"

#: b2/config/config.cpp:88
msgid "Minimize Window"
msgstr "Minimalizëjë òkno"

#: b2/config/config.cpp:89
msgid "Shade Window"
msgstr "Zwinie òkno"

#: b2/config/config.cpp:90
msgid "Close Window"
msgstr "Zamkni òkno"

#: b2/config/config.cpp:93
msgid ""
"An action can be associated to a double click of the menu button. Leave it "
"to none if in doubt."
msgstr ""
"Dzejanié przepisóné do dëbeltnégò klëkniãcô na knąpie menu. Jeżlë trëchlësz, "
"nie zmieniwôj negò nastôwù."

#: b2/b2client.cpp:412
msgid "Resize"
